Package: citezot
Title: Pull Cited References from Zotero into Quarto Bibliographies
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Joel", "Nitta", , "joelnitta@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Scans Quarto and R Markdown documents for citation keys,
    pulls the matching items from the Zotero web API, and writes a
    bibliography file. Also provides dry-run-by-default helpers to find,
    add, and update Zotero items.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Imports: 
    cli,
    rlang
